    {
      "text": "mark upon Cain, lest any finding him should kill him, Gen. 4:15 (Moses 5:40). Reuben … said, Let us not kill him, Gen. 37:21. intendest thou to kill me, as thou killedst the Egyptian, Ex. 2:14 (Acts 7:28). Thou shalt not kill, Ex. 20:13 (Deut. 5:17; Matt. 5:21; Mark 10:19; Luke 18:20; Rom. 13:9; James 2:11; Mosiah 13:21; 3 Ne. 12:21; D&C 132:36). he that killeth any man shall surely be put to death, Lev. 24:17. kill every male … and kill every woman that hath known man, Num. 31:17. revenger of blood kill the slayer, Num. 35:27. I kill, and I make alive, Deut. 32:39 (1 Sam. 2:6). thou hast killed Uriah the Hittite, 2 Sam. 12:9. destroy, to kill, and to cause to perish, all Jews, Esth. 3:13. for thy sake are we killed all the day, Ps. 44:22 (Rom. 8:36). time to kill, and a time to heal, Eccl. 3:3.",
